Package: qpost
Title: Create and Edit 'Quarto' Blog Posts
Version: 1.1.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Peter", "Baumgartner", , "petzi53@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4526-8791"))
Description: Provides interactive 'RStudio' and 'Positron' dialogs for creating 'Quarto' blog posts with structured YAML front matter and editing the metadata of existing posts. The package can scaffold post directories, create 'index.qmd' files, optionally copy images, and add COinS (ContextObjects in Spans) metadata for automatic bibliographic import into reference managers such as 'Zotero'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
